{
  "_comment": "Model providers for TrueForge. Copy to config/models.json (git-ignored), keep the providers you use, put the keys referenced as ${ENV_VAR} in a .env file (or export them), then run: node scripts/register-models.mjs --env <path to .env>. Providers whose key is missing, or whose base_url still has a <placeholder>, are skipped. Keys are never written to this repository. Fallback (forgeAgent.fallbackModels): nvidia-backup is a separate provider entry, so a broken key or URL on the primary 'nvidia' entry does not break it; groq is a second vendor for small requests (its free tier allows 8,000 tokens per minute).",
